        <p class="dock-week-total"><b>0</b> registros</p>
        <div class="dock-week-days"><span><i></i>dom</span><span><i></i>lun</span><span><i></i>mar</span><span><i></i>mié</span><span><i></i>jue</span><span><i></i>vie</span><span><i></i>sáb</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav class="dg-dock dg-dock-bar" data-dg-dock aria-label="Principal">
      <button type="button" class="dg-dock-item" aria-label="Destacados"><svg class="dg-icon"><use href="#dg-star"/></svg></button>
      <button type="button" class="dg-dock-item" aria-label="Tienda"><svg class="dg-icon"><use href="#dg-grid"/></svg></button>
      <button type="button" class="dg-dock-item" aria-label="Mensajes"><svg class="dg-icon"><use href="#dg-mail"/></svg></button>
      <button type="button" class="dg-dock-item is-active" aria-label="Perfil"><svg class="dg-icon"><use href="#dg-user"/></svg></button>
    </nav>
  </div>
  <span class="dock-phone-home dock-phone-home-light" aria-hidden="true"></span>
</div></div>
</div>
<div class="doc-code">
<button class="cp">Copiar</button>
<pre>&lt;div class=&quot;dg-dock-layout&quot;&gt;
  &lt;main&gt;…contenido…&lt;/main&gt;
  &lt;nav class=&quot;dg-dock dg-dock-bar&quot; data-dg-dock aria-label=&quot;Principal&quot;&gt;
    &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-dock-item&quot; aria-label=&quot;Destacados&quot;&gt;…&lt;/button&gt;
    &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-dock-item&quot; aria-label=&quot;Tienda&quot;&gt;…&lt;/button&gt;
    &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-dock-item&quot; aria-label=&quot;Mensajes&quot;&gt;…&lt;/button&gt;
    &lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;dg-dock-item is-active&quot; aria-label=&quot;Perfil&quot;&gt;…&lt;/button&gt;
  &lt;/nav&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

/* Curva de las esquinas del contenido (por defecto 2rem) */
.dg-dock-layout { --dg-dock-tuck: 2.5rem; }</pre>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="dock-pequeno" class="dock-doc-section">
<div class="doc-sub">Tamaño pequeño</div>
<p class="dg-muted dg-text-sm dg-mb-4"><code>.dg-dock-sm</code> reduce botones e iconos para barras secundarias o pantallas densas. También puedes ajustar <code>--dg-dock-item</code>, <code>--dg-dock-icon</code> y <code>--dg-dock-pad</code>.</p>
<div class="doc-example">
<div class="doc-demo is-plain dock-demo">
<nav class="dg-dock dg-dock-sm" data-dg-dock aria-label="Herramientas">
  <button type="button" class="dg-dock-item is-active" aria-label="Inicio"><svg class="dg-icon"><use href="#dg-home"/></svg></button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-dock-item" aria-label="Bandeja"><svg class="dg-icon"><use href="#dg-inbox"/></svg></button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-dock-item" aria-label="Calendario"><svg class="dg-icon"><use href="#dg-calendar"/></svg></button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-dock-item" aria-label="Ajustes"><svg class="dg-icon"><use href="#dg-settings"/></svg></button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-dock-item" aria-label="Perfil"><svg class="dg-icon"><use href="#dg-user"/></svg></button>
</nav>
</div>
<div class="doc-code">
<button class="cp">Copiar</button>
<pre>&lt;nav class="dg-dock dg-dock-sm" data-dg-dock aria-label="Herramientas"&gt;…&lt;/nav&gt;

/* O a medida */
.mi-dock { --dg-dock-item: 3rem; --dg-dock-icon: 1.25rem; }</pre>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="dock-glass" class="dock-doc-section">
<div class="doc-sub">Glass</div>
<p class="dg-muted dg-text-sm dg-mb-4">Sólido por defecto. Sobre fotos o video añade <code>.is-glass</code>, o usa <code>data-surface="glass"</code> en <code>&lt;html&gt;</code> para todos los flotantes. Con <em>reducir transparencia</em> vuelve a sólido.</p>
<div class="doc-example">
<div class="doc-demo glass-stage dock-demo">
<nav class="dg-dock is-glass" data-dg-dock aria-label="Apariencia">
  <button type="button" class="dg-dock-item is-active" aria-label="Claro"><svg class="dg-icon"><use href="#dg-sun"/></svg></button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-dock-item" aria-label="Oscuro"><svg class="dg-icon"><use href="#dg-moon"/></svg></button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-dock-item" aria-label="Estadísticas"><svg class="dg-icon"><use href="#dg-chart"/></svg></button>
  <button type="button" class="dg-dock-item" aria-label="Favoritos"><svg class="dg-icon"><use href="#dg-star"/></svg></button>
</nav>
</div>
<div class="doc-code">
<button class="cp">Copiar</button>
<pre>&lt;nav class="dg-dock is-glass" data-dg-dock aria-label="Apariencia"&gt;…&lt;/nav&gt;</pre>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="dock-evento" class="dock-doc-section">
<div class="doc-sub">Escuchar el cambio</div>
<p class="dg-muted dg-text-sm dg-mb-4">Cada vez que cambia la opción activa, el dock emite <code>dg:change</code> con el valor (<code>data-value</code>, o si no el <code>aria-label</code>) y su posición. Las flechas ← → mueven el foco; Enter o Espacio activan.</p>
<div class="doc-code">
<button class="cp">Copiar</button>
<pre>document.querySelector('.dg-dock').addEventListener('dg:change', (event) =&gt; {
  console.log(event.detail.value, event.detail.index); // "Estadísticas", 2
});</pre>
</div>
</section>`;
---

<Layout title="Navegación" lead="Navbar horizontal, nav vertical, tabs, control segmentado y menú inferior (dock)." currentHref="/componentes/nav">
  <Fragment set:html={pageContent} />
</Layout>
<style is:global>
  .dock-doc-section { scroll-margin-top: 80px; }
  #navbar, [id^="navbar-"] { scroll-margin-top: 80px; }
  .doc-demo.navbar-stage { padding: 0; background: var(--dg-surface-2); }
  .navbar-page { display: grid; gap: .6rem; padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem 1.75rem; }
  .navbar-page span { display: block; height: .55rem; border-radius: 99px; background: var(--dg-surface-3); }
  .navbar-page span:nth-child(1) { width: 42%; height: .9rem; }
  .navbar-page span:nth-child(2) { width: 78%; }
  .navbar-page span:nth-child(3) { width: 64%; }
  .glass-stage .navbar-page span { background: rgb(255 255 255 / .35); }
  .dock-demo { display: grid; place-items: center; padding-block: 2.5rem; }
  .dock-phone { width: min(100%, 22rem); padding: 10px; border-radius: 3rem; background: #d9d6cf; }
  .dock-phone-screen { position: relative; height: 15rem; border-radius: 2.4rem; background: var(--dg-surface-2); overflow: hidden; }
  .dock-phone-home { position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: 8px; width: 34%; height: 5px; translate: -50% 0; border-radius: 99px; background: var(--dg-text); }
  .dock-phone .dg-dock-fixed { bottom: 26px; }
  .dock-phone-stack { display: flex; flex-direction: column; height: 24rem; }
  .dock-phone-content { flex: 1; padding: 2.75rem 1.25rem 1rem; }
  .dock-phone-title { margin: 0 0 .25rem; font-family: var(--dg-font-serif); font-size: 1.75rem; }
  .dock-phone .dg-dock-bar { padding-bottom: 24px; }
  .dock-phone-layout { flex: 1; }
  .dock-phone-layout > .dock-sheet { flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; padding: 2.5rem .75rem .75rem; background: var(--dg-paper); }
  .dock-week { width: 100%; padding: 1.1rem 1.1rem .9rem; border-radius: 1.5rem; background: var(--dg-surface-2); }
  .dock-week-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; font-size: .95rem; }
  .dock-week-total { margin: .6rem 0 1.1rem; color: var(--dg-text-muted); font-size: .9rem; }
  .dock-week-total b { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--dg-text-muted); margin-right: .25rem; }
  .dock-week-days { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(7, 1fr); text-align: center; font-size: .7rem; color: var(--dg-text-muted); }
  .dock-week-days i { display: block; width: 14px; height: 4px; margin: 0 auto .45rem; border-radius: 99px; background: var(--dg-text); }
  .dock-phone-home-light { background: var(--dg-0); }
</style>
